      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Prompt Mage · Main Archmage workflow\nPublic default version of the Zine workflow. No LoRAs or extra node packs.\n\n1. Download the three MOSS files below; choose their filenames in the loaders.\n2. DART v3 needs access approval on Hugging Face; accept terms and authenticate on the ComfyUI server if required. It downloads into the Hugging Face cache.\n3. DART supplies scene ideas; Appearance Overrides defines your subject. Add your own idea or writing rules in Archmage.\n4. Resolution drives both Archmage and the latent. Run to generate an image.\n\n- [MOSS base → models/diffusion_models](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n- [Qwen 9B INT8 → models/text_encoders](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors?download=true)\n- [Flux.2 VAE → models/vae](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors?download=true)\n- [DART v3 access/model card](https://huggingface.co/p1atdev/dart-v3-sft-preview-E)\n\nDefaults: local shared Qwen, Bright lifestyle, JSON, 1 MP portrait, 50 steps, Euler, CFG 3, shift 5. Thinking is off for a shorter first run. No character trigger or custom appearance is baked in. Switch Output format to Prose to compare. JSON layout placement is experimental.\n\n[Model guide](https://github.com/Renz1998/ComfyUI-Prompt-Mage/blob/main/docs/MODEL_DOWNLOADS.md) · [Community / help](https://github.com/Renz1998/ComfyUI-Prompt-Mage/issues)"
      ]
    }
